   "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/ce6a89059dd6ccebbd8ecb3961ee9dec.poster.avif?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/ce6a89059dd6ccebbd8ecb3961ee9dec.webm?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/ce6a89059dd6ccebbd8ecb3961ee9dec.mp4?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>奠定新基礎，開創屬於你的足球命運。採用 Unity 引擎打造，《FM26》不只傳承經典，更全面革新，就連敘事方式也與時俱進。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全新的介面設計與更具沉浸感的比賽日體驗，讓你更貼近場上每一刻，昇華每一個改變戰局的瞬間。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >透過進階轉會工具改造你的球隊，並以前所未有的創新方式打造屬於你的足球哲學，並帶來無與倫比的戰術真實感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/28ee531a0361c2b67572de04b9786f18.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span><br>在足球界最盛大的國際賽事奪下冠軍的美夢不遠了。探索全新的國家隊管理工具，並透過專為《FIFA WORLD CUP 2026™》打造的指定開賽日功能展開征途。本產品已獲得官方授權，收錄最原汁原味的轉播畫質、賽事品牌要素、比賽專屬球與球衣。<br>[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/0d829ea05c0f9207e27b6a3f1e0ae841.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>享受系列史上最豐富的比賽日體驗。球員動作更流暢，場上細節更細緻，每場比賽都充滿前所未見的深度與戲劇張力。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >體驗靈巧盤球、精準直塞與最後一刻的致勝進球時，腎上腺素飆升的刺激感。全新動態捕捉和體積動畫，讓每次進攻更有個性。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.poster.avif?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.webm?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.mp4?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/613aacbf5ac9b3731094136b8fa2fc17.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>英超聯賽於本遊戲中首次登場，並完整授權球會徽章、球衣與官方球員照片，讓玩家得以在英國足球界的最高殿堂互相競逐。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >真實感再升級，玩家將以最佳視角，享受完整的轉播體驗，為爭取國內足球比賽的最高榮耀發起挑戰。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/8a95b8760f5fedb4ad56bb1ebbab027c.poster.avif?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/8a95b8760f5fedb4ad56bb1ebbab027c.webm?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/8a95b8760f5fedb4ad56bb1ebbab027c.mp4?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/40bf5d119bc507db7945d0199157e6d9.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>新增控球與未控球時的獨立陣型設定，在場上各區域精準掌握球隊的踢法。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >重新詮釋球員角色與動態視覺化工具，清楚呈現球隊在各種情況下的表現，讓賽前準備全面升級。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/88de697dce63195fb37fb630694c713c.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>全新改版的介面為現代經理而設計，帶來更簡潔的視覺與操作體驗。而全新的「入口平台」將足球世界中的各個層面匯集在一起。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入快捷連結「書籤」，讓遊戲體驗依優先事項量身調整。搭配全面改版的搜尋與全新的「FMPedia」術語庫，帶玩家更深入了解足球世界。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/71bf94217a8c1c062c225b9ebbabe9c9.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>女子足球的登場開啟了全新的可能性，並完美融入《FM》生態系，共同打造一個無界限的足球世界。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收錄來自 11 個國家的 14 個可遊玩聯賽，包含英格蘭女子足球超級聯賽（WSL）與美國國家女子足球聯賽（NWSL）。每段生涯都有全新的挑戰與待玩家發掘的新星。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/c94f68675d875381591b98950ba5b29e.poster.avif?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/c94f68675d875381591b98950ba5b29e.webm?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/c94f68675d875381591b98950ba5b29e.mp4?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/2bf56e611d54e4da025b55bf9dd0f551.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>有效地運用強大的 TransferRoom™ 系統，在一季接著一季的奮戰中持續打造冠軍陣容。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >張貼「需求」並向全球俱樂部公開引援優先事項，並利用「報價機會」直接掌握對手需求，讓玩家在每一筆簽約與出售中擁有更精準的掌控力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/960686ed3c1028f7d82e7b00f67d0fce.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>全面翻新的經理建立體驗，讓玩家在每一段生涯裡展現更多個性與風格。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >透過升級的角色編輯器打造外型，建立專屬生涯背景。這些設定將會實際影響場邊日常與執教風格。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.poster.avif?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.webm?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.mp4?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《FM26》中，足球只專屬於你和你的願景。現在，就是你改變比賽的時刻。 </p><br>※由於授權核准程序仍在進行中，《FIFA WORLD CUP 2026™》功能推出時將無法提供所有參賽隊伍的球衣套裝。部分球衣套裝將於後續更新加入。",
