height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.webm?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.mp4?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/613aacbf5ac9b3731094136b8fa2fc17.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>英超聯賽於本遊戲中首次登場，並完整授權球會徽章、球衣與官方球員照片，讓玩家得以在英國足球界的最高殿堂互相競逐。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >真實感再升級，玩家將以最佳視角，享受完整的轉播體驗，為爭取國內足球比賽的最高榮耀發起挑戰。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/8a95b8760f5fedb4ad56bb1ebbab027c.poster.avif?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/8a95b8760f5fedb4ad56bb1ebbab027c.webm?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/8a95b8760f5fedb4ad56bb1ebbab027c.mp4?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/40bf5d119bc507db7945d0199157e6d9.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>新增控球與未控球時的獨立陣型設定，在場上各區域精準掌握球隊的踢法。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >重新詮釋球員角色與動態視覺化工具，清楚呈現球隊在各種情況下的表現，讓賽前準備全面升級。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/88de697dce63195fb37fb630694c713c.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>全新改版的介面為現代經理而設計，帶來更簡潔的視覺與操作體驗。而全新的「入口平台」將足球世界中的各個層面匯集在一起。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入快捷連結「書籤」，讓遊戲體驗依優先事項量身調整。搭配全面改版的搜尋與全新的「FMPedia」術語庫，帶玩家更深入了解足球世界。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/71bf94217a8c1c062c225b9ebbabe9c9.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>女子足球的登場開啟了全新的可能性，並完美融入《FM》生態系，共同打造一個無界限的足球世界。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >收錄來自 11 個國家的 14 個可遊玩聯賽，包含英格蘭女子足球超級聯賽（WSL）與美國國家女子足球聯賽（NWSL）。每段生涯都有全新的挑戰與待玩家發掘的新星。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/c94f68675d875381591b98950ba5b29e.poster.avif?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/c94f68675d875381591b98950ba5b29e.webm?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/c94f68675d875381591b98950ba5b29e.mp4?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/2bf56e611d54e4da025b55bf9dd0f551.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>有效地運用強大的 TransferRoom™ 系統，在一季接著一季的奮戰中持續打造冠軍陣容。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >張貼「需求」並向全球俱樂部公開引援優先事項，並利用「報價機會」直接掌握對手需求，讓玩家在每一筆簽約與出售中擁有更精準的掌控力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/960686ed3c1028f7d82e7b00f67d0fce.webp?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=57 /></span>全面翻新的經理建立體驗，讓玩家在每一段生涯裡展現更多個性與風格。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >透過升級的角色編輯器打造外型，建立專屬生涯背景。這些設定將會實際影響場邊日常與執教風格。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.poster.avif?t=1781176251\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.webm?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551340/extras/20d3b0eeaeb00c8495a2a780a87b4a5c.mp4?t=1781176251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《FM26》中，足球只專屬於你和你的願景。現在，就是你改變比賽的時刻。 </p><br>※由於授權核准程序仍在進行中，《FIFA WORLD CUP 2026™》功能推出時將無法提供所有參賽隊伍的球衣套裝。部分球衣套裝將於後續更新加入。",
   "short_description": "走進教練席，親身體驗足球管理的未來。",
